def build_balance_map(ids, balances):
    """Return a dictionary mapping each account ID to its balance.

    The input lists must be the same length. Account identifiers are used
    as the dictionary keys without conversion, so a non-string ID keeps its
    type. If the lengths differ, a ValueError is raised rather than
    silently truncating the output.
